  "record_note": "Checked against the official source on 2026-11-06: every point-in-time version on e-Laws of each act in the record, file by file and by letters and digits against the raw text. English text in force only (text of amendments not yet in force is left out). Each act starts with its first point-in-time version on e-Laws (2000s for most older acts), so earlier history is not in the record. The first four acts were built in date order (2026-10-29); every other act was appended later as its own block of commits (an end block: its dates run back from the commits above it; date each version by In-force, never by commit order). 0 acts repealed before their first version are not in it. Regulations are not included.",
